Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:39:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 135/147] hjviewer: integration fixes for 1.9 wave 3

U15: lanes keys and phonefiles both wrote hjvFileRowColors. Keep lane
keys' common/hjv_session_look.dart (same values, plus the desktop row's
border, which the phone row does not read), point the phone file page
at it, and drop hjv_phone_files_look.dart and its test;
hjviewer_session_look_test.dart covers the function in both themes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
